{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなバカな・・・MV公開！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃奇坂女子学院アイドル部のエース役です\n目印はエースの印ピンクリボン！\nたくさんの鏡に向かって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可愛い可愛い〜！どの私を見ても可愛いわぁぁぁ〜〜〜！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じでお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って振り付けの方に言われて全力でやり切りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際はこんなキャラじゃないけどね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビのダンスも、いくちゃんと一緒に必死に踊ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/22/2679019/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひたくさん見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆告知☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙を飾らせて頂きました、Ray一月号と、Samurai ELOが発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rayは私のホンネが書かれていたり、心の内をたくさん語っています。\nSamurai ELOは嬉しいことに四回目の表紙です！ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとみさみさと一緒に撮影しました(＾ｰ^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら見てみてください！\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/22/2679019/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタももうすぐ発売です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、今日から放送していますサマンサティアラのCMに出演しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの可愛いジュエリーに囲まれて、とっても楽しい撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ赤なワンピースが目印です(^ ^)\n是非、サマンサティアラで素敵なクリスマスを♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/22/2679019/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「暇〜誰かかまって〜〜」 の図。\n※かずみん撮影"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事の空き時間中。\n衣装のラックに絡まってます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知が多くなってしまってすみません(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し頑張ってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}